# ==========================================
# POSTGRESQL DATABASE CONNECTION
# ==========================================
# Provide your live PostgreSQL DB connection string below for production deployment.
# You can get a free one from Neon (https://neon.tech) or Supabase (https://supabase.com).
# Example:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://johndoe:randompassword@localhost:5432/mydb?schema=public"

# If left empty/commented, the app will continue to function without saving 
# history to the database, ensuring zero downtime even if DB fails.
DATABASE_URL=""
